    "body": "This conflicts with main (now d7e9a807). One file: `crates/app/src/posting_per_op.rs`, where both sides changed the same program-number derivation - your branch resolves the document's program id through `document_program_id`/setup/effective-post, main numbers ops from the index (`u32::try_from(index)`). Same-logic on both sides, so it needs your judgement (the #902 document-units law says posted numbers come from one document-level setting - likely main's line should fold into your derivation, but that is yours to decide). Please `git merge upstream/main`, resolve deliberately, and push.\n",
